Package: keen-pbr-headless
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, conntrack, iptables | nftables
Suggests: xtables-addons-dkms, dnsmasq
Description: keen-pbr-sing policy routing without REST API and Web UI
 keen-pbr-sing routes selected traffic through a sing-box TUN on Keenetic.
 Based on keen-pbr by Maxim Kurbatov. The package name remains keen-pbr-headless.
 This package installs the daemon and helper scripts without the REST API or frontend assets.
 Install xtables-addons-dkms only when using the iptables backend.
